OL,3,GNEWSASunderland fans soak up Portugal
OL,4,Asun ahead of clash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of Sunderland fans have made
OL,7,Fthe journey to north-west Portugal for
OL,8,Fthe team's first competitive fixture on
OL,9,Fmainland Europe in 53 years.
OL,11,FSunderland AFC play Portuguese second
OL,12,Fdivision team Torreense in the Europa
OL,13,FLeague later but as the host's grounds
OL,14,Fare so small, the game is being held
OL,15,Fabout 66 miles (106km) away in the city
OL,16,Fof Leiria.
OL,18,FSpeaking from the sun-soaked city, Luke
OL,19,FThompson showed off his new chest
OL,20,Ftattoo commemorating Sunderland's entry
OL,21,Fto the league.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
